{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/931025-npc-idea-billy-skull-trainer-of-slashers","id":931025,"title":"[NPC Idea] Billy Skull, Trainer Of Slashers","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Beast: The Primordial"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-07-13T14:34:38-07:00","id":931025,"title":"[NPC Idea] Billy Skull, Trainer Of Slashers","content":"I remembered that Slashers are considered Kin, so my mind started coming up with possible backgrounds for a Beast that considers them his family. Right now, I'm thinking of an ex-forensic scientist who was Devoured by a young vigilante Beast. This vigilante was a typical street-stalking Nemesis who wanted a partner in her Feedings and followed a strict code of not hurting innocents. She was killed by a Hero who took advantage of her code of honor by luring her into a trap where she had to sacrifice herself to save a child the Hero kidnapped and put in danger.<br /> <br /> This awoke a deep fascination with killers inside Billy, who refuses to use his real name. He thinks that Slashers, Hunters and Heroes share some common thread between them in the Primordial Dream. He wants to train the right vigilantes by taking them under his wing and protecting them from the common law, and get rid of those who do not meet his standards.<br /> <br /> He'd be an Ugallu Tyrant + Nemesis who makes good use of his forensic knowledge, people-reading skills and supernatural powers to notice when potential Slashers are on the loose. He helps the Slashers by keeping them safe and training them, and helps Hunters by following them in hunts for the worst of Slashers.<br /> <br /> His name is a reference to his costumed persona, but his Horror is quite different. It is a translucent, slender creature with worm-like skin, clad in a ragged lab coat. Its long neck ends in a biomechanical flashlight, like something that hovers above the remains of a crime scene. Its arachnid arms end in scalpels, its lower body is a mess of silent tentacles, and the whole monster is totally pale and pristine.<br /> <br /> His Lair could be a mix of prison and underground lab, where he conducts evaluation sessions to see which Slashers are worthy of being his crimefighters, and which need to be thrown to the Hunters.<br /> <br /> Aspirations would be: rid the city of organized crime, find and train the potential ultimate Slasher, help Hunters protect the innocent.<br /> <br /> Quote: &quot;I didn't help you because I think you're right. I'm gonna make you understand who deserves to be spared.&quot;<br /> <br /> Does this sound like an interesting NPC? He could alternate between ally and enemy, so any Hunter PCs should stay alert around him. I already have a partially written character sheet, so I want to know who is interested in seeing more details.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Bye.","edited":{"userid":4443,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","user":"GibberingEloquence","date":". 07-13-2016, 06:36 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","name":"GibberingEloquence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4443_5.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2470"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}